      "versionNonce": 2063,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solid arrow = direct import. Dashed arrow = adapter resolved through a registry by name at run time. Same-lane calls (runs/ -> alerts/, ckpt/ -> runs/) and infrastructure -> domain imports are not drawn.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Solid arrow = direct import. Dashed arrow = adapter resolved through a registry by name at run time. Same-lane calls (runs/ -> alerts/, ckpt/ -> runs/) and infrastructure -> domain imports are not drawn.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jLLzMxQByhB4Iy6Nd0PGO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1208,
      "width": 1222.3681640625,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b02",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1064,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 2064,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "hooks/ is entered by the training framework and talks to runs/ only through the MetricSink protocol in core/schema.py; runs/ hands flushed batches to forward/ through bounded queues, one worker thread per forwarder.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "hooks/ is entered by the training framework and talks to runs/ only through the MetricSink protocol in core/schema.py; runs/ hands flushed batches to forward/ through bounded queues, one worker thread per forwarder.",
